  (text
    "vibsensor: STM32G473 + IIS3DWB + TMP117 + TCAN1044V on a round board, potted in the sensor's housing.\nTwo M8 4-pin sockets (1 V+, 2 CAN_H, 3 GND, 4 CAN_L): IN (J1) and OUT (J3), the bus and supply passed through;\nthe last sensor's OUT takes a terminator plug (120 ohm). Node number and name over the bus (no jumpers).\nConnections are by net name (net labels): docs/vibsensor.md and vibsensor/inc/vs.h are the reference."
    (at 25.4 272.22 0)
